mock --root rhel-7-s390x --rebuild zlib-1.2.7-18.el7.src.rpm

The Makefile also includes CentOS URLs for ppc64le, aarch64, and x86_64 RPMs.

To download all RPMs and check that they replicate the tarballs included in the
RHEL devkit SRPM, invoke:

make
